{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"story_mostma_set_2_story_1","storyGroup":"story_mostma_set_2","storySort":0,"storyDependence":null,"storyCanShow":0,"storyCode":null,"storyName":"旅途的注脚","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"应当为在天灾中逝去的镇民建立一座怎样的雕像？两个工匠为此产生了分歧。僵持不下之际，莫斯提马造访了镇子......","storyCanEnter":0,"storyTxt":"obt/memory/story_mostma_2_1","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":0,"requiredStages":null,"characters":["朴实的镇长","犹豫的女性","稳重的女性","莫斯提马","蕾缪乐"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_bg_bg_county_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$path_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/a001/m_dia_path_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":9},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_005","id":10},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朴实的镇长","text":"五年前，一场天灾，将我们的深根镇毁于一旦。","id":11,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_005","id":12},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朴实的镇长","text":"多亏了圣城使者的援手，我们才得以在这片新的土地上重新繁衍生息。","id":13,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_005","id":14},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朴实的镇长","text":"五年过去了，现在，新的深根镇已经像模像样了，我们也终于能够腾出手来重振深根镇的传统艺术——雕塑。","id":15,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_005","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朴实的镇长","text":"曾经的深根镇中央总是摆放着我们最好的工匠的作品。","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_005","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朴实的镇长","text":"现在，我希望重拾这种传统，由我们现在最好的工匠雕刻一座雕像，用这座雕像，祭奠那些没能逃过天灾的镇民们。","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":20},{"type":"charslot","id":21},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_applause","volume":"0.6","id":22},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":23},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_005","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朴实的镇长","text":"苏珊，你的父亲生前是镇上最好的工匠，这些年，你的努力大家也看在眼里，你愿意接过这份工作吗？","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_003","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"犹豫的女性","text":"我——如果父亲没有被天灾......他一定有办法。","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_003.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_003","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"犹豫的女性","text":"但......我不知道现在的自己能不能做得到，我也不知道自己有没有做好准备。","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_003.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_003","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"犹豫的女性","text":"纪念那些逝去的人，这太沉重了。","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_003.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_005","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朴实的镇长","text":"我知道，这对你来说是一个艰巨的挑战，只是，现在镇子上已经没有其他人——","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":34},{"type":"charslot","id":35},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":36},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":37},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"既然苏珊没有把握，可以让我试一试吗？","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_005","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朴实的镇长","text":"梅丽莎？！你、你怎么从拉特兰回来了？！","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"您给我的信里提到镇子打算重新建立一座雕像，我就立刻启程出发了。","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"虽然我当时跟着使者回到了圣城，但是，我心中一直还把自己当作深根镇的人。","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_005","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朴实的镇长","text":"好，好。","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_005","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朴实的镇长","text":"你说，你想来负责雕像的雕刻，是吗？","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"是的，回到拉特兰后，我开始钻研雕刻技术，一直等待着能够重新为镇子出一份力的这一天到来。","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_005","id":52},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朴实的镇长","text":"难为你有这个心了。既然这样......","id":53,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_003","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"犹豫的女性","text":"等等！","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_003.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_003","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"犹豫的女性","text":"在镇子被毁灭前，竖立在镇子中央的那座雕像，就是我父亲的杰作。","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_003.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_003","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"犹豫的女性","text":"那座雕像......很特殊，每个镇里人都说，靠近那座雕像，就能闻到独属于这座镇子的气味。","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_003.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_003","id":60},{"type":"dialogue","name":"犹豫的女性","text":"我觉得......还原那座雕像，才是祭奠他们的最好方式。","id":61,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_003.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"但是，你能还原那种气味吗？","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_003","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"犹豫的女性","text":"我——我不确定，但是，我想试一试！","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_003.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"听着，苏珊。","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"镇子上剩下的人，不会永远等着你找回“特殊”的传统。","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"有时候，延续本身更重要。","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_003","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"犹豫的女性","text":"......我知道。","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_003.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_003","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"犹豫的女性","text":"（低声）父亲原来常去的地方......","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_003.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_003","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"犹豫的女性","text":"（低声）虽然危险，但是......","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_003.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":78},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","id":79},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":80},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":81},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_005","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朴实的镇长","text":"等等，苏珊，你要去哪？","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"她去的方向......啧，说过火了吗，我去把她拉回来——","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":86},{"type":"charslot","id":87},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_213_mostma_1#12$2","duration":"1","id":88},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫斯提马","text":"苏珊就交给我吧。","id":90,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_213_mostma_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_005","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朴实的镇长","text":"你是——莫斯提马小姐？！","id":92,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"莫斯提马？！","id":94,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_213_mostma_1#7$2","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫斯提马","text":"好久不见了，镇长，还有梅丽莎。","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ef/Avg_avg_213_mostma_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_005","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朴实的镇长","text":"安多恩队长和其他人还好吗？","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_213_mostma_1#12$2","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫斯提马","text":"......呵呵，他们都挺好的。","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_213_mostma_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"你......","id":102,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_213_mostma_1#12$2","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫斯提马","text":"之后再聊吧。","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_213_mostma_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":105},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","id":106},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":107},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":108},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1810_1#1$1","focus":"m","duration":"1","id":109},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪乐","text":"请问，是梅丽莎小姐吗，啊，一定是你没错了！","id":111},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"你是——","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1810_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪乐","text":"我把你雕刻需要用的材料都送过来了！","id":115},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1810_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":116},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪乐","text":"对了，请问你见过一个叫莫斯提马的萨科塔吗？","id":117},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"（低声）......莫斯提马，你是特意选这个时间来的吗——","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1810_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪乐","text":"欸？","id":121},{"type":"dialog","id":122},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":123},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":124},{"type":"charslot","id":125},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":126},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_bg_bg_county_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":127},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":128},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":129},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1810_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪乐","text":"所以莫斯提马去哪了？","id":131},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"她刚才上山去了。","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"恐怕一时半会回不来。","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1810_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪乐","text":"哦——好吧。","id":137},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1810_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪乐","text":"那我先来帮你的忙吧！","id":139},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":140},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"你就这么接受了她丢给你的事情？","id":141,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1810_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪乐","text":"我一直在找她。","id":143},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1810_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪乐","text":"每一次到一个新的地方，我都会像这样凑巧遇到一些和找她一样有趣的事可以做。","id":145},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"听起来她是故意的。","id":147,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1810_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪乐","text":"我不知道欸，但是莫斯提马以前就是这样的。","id":149},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1810_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪乐","text":"小的时候，我每次找她去搞爆炸，她都不会陪我。","id":151},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1810_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪乐","text":"但是有好几次，我发现，她其实一直在远远地看着我。","id":153},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"呵。","id":155,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1810_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪乐","text":"你呢，你又是怎么认识莫斯提马的？","id":157},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":158},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"......","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"五年前，我们曾经的镇子深根镇被天灾毁了。","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"我和我的父亲是唯二幸存的萨科塔。","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"圣城接到父亲的求援，派了一支小队过来接走我们。","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1810_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪乐","text":"（那支小队，就是姐姐曾经所在的小队......）","id":167},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"不过，他们的队长安多恩没有直接带走我们。","id":169,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"他带着队友，把其他幸存下来的不是萨科塔的难民，护送到了现在这里。","id":171,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"还为他们向圣城申请了物资——我后来才知道，他们全队预支了一整年的工资，扛下了这件事。","id":173,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":174},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":175},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":176},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":177},{"type":"charslot","id":178},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":179},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/38/Avg_bg_bg_caveentrance.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":180},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":181},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":182},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$drift_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_drift_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":183,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":184},{"type":"sticker","id":185,"multi":"true","text":"莫斯提马，你问我，为什么我如此眉头紧锁。","x":"300","y":"270","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":186,"multi":"true","text":"\\n我反而想问你，你能做到问心无愧吗？","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":187},{"type":"sticker","id":188,"multi":"true","text":"我们只能为这些并非萨科塔的难民做到这么多了。","x":"300","y":"270","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":189,"multi":"true","text":"\\n我们只能将他们带到一片新的土地，为他们送去一些物资，然后就此离开，带着我们的同胞回到圣城拉特兰。","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":190,"multi":"true","text":"\\n这里发生的一切与我们无关，有美好的生活在等着我们回去享受。","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":191,"multi":"true","text":"\\n这一切似乎理所当然。","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":192,"multi":"true","text":"\\n他们接受了这一点，我们也接受了这一点。","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":193},{"type":"sticker","id":194,"multi":"true","text":"但是，为什么？","x":"300","y":"270","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":195},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":196},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":197},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_213_mostma_1#10$2","duration":"2","id":198},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫斯提马","text":"算算时间，小乐现在应该已经在梅丽莎那里开始工作了。","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5f/Avg_avg_213_mostma_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_213_mostma_1#10$2","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫斯提马","text":"梅丽莎了解的过去，或许可以稍微满足一些她的好奇心。","id":202,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5f/Avg_avg_213_mostma_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_213_mostma_1#12$2","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫斯提马","text":"找到你了，苏珊。","id":204,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_213_mostma_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_003","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"犹豫的女性","text":"......","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_003.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_003","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"犹豫的女性","text":"这里就是父亲过去经常来的地方。","id":208,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_003.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_003","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"犹豫的女性","text":"从这里，可以眺望整座镇子。","id":210,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_003.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_003","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"犹豫的女性","text":"每当他心情不好的时候，他就会来这里，远远看着镇子。","id":212,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_003.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_003","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"犹豫的女性","text":"他常说，真正的铭记不是储存信息，而是让触摸雕像的人能想起旧日的味道。","id":214,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_003.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_003","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"犹豫的女性","text":"但是——父亲，现在，我站在这里只能看到一片废墟。","id":216,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_003.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_213_mostma_1#1$2","id":217},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫斯提马","text":"......","id":218,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_213_mostma_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_213_mostma_1#1$2","id":219},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫斯提马","text":"那座雕像，看起来还没有完全损坏。","id":220,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_213_mostma_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_213_mostma_1#12$2","id":221},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫斯提马","text":"我去去就回。","id":222,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_213_mostma_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":223},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":224},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":225},{"type":"charslot","id":226},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":227},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_bg_31_g4_mini12_village.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":228},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":229},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":230},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1810_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪乐","text":"哇哦，这块石头可真大。","id":232},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1810_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪乐","text":"这不是做一个雕像要用的石头吧？","id":234},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"是啊。我从一开始就想好了，我想要做一组雕像，用来纪念那些逝去的人们。","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"你在拉特兰也看到过类似的雕像组吧？","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1810_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":239},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪乐","text":"啊——你是说广场上那种。","id":240},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"是啊，我想雕刻一组那样的雕像，然后，将所有遇难者的名字都收集起来刻在上面。","id":242,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1810_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪乐","text":"听起来就像教堂里的那些壁画一样。","id":244},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"聪明。","id":246,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1810_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪乐","text":"嘿嘿。你刚才说，你是回到拉特兰后，才开始学习雕塑的？","id":248},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":249},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"是啊，虽说深根镇曾经以雕塑闻名，但也不是每个人都喜欢雕塑。","id":250,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"我就是其中之一。","id":252,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"老实说，我不太适应拉特兰的生活。","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"可能是在深根镇生活惯了的原因，我不太能接受拉特兰那种特别欢快的氛围。","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1810_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪乐","text":"啊——我能理解。","id":258},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1810_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪乐","text":"可能是这两年追着莫斯提马到处跑的原因吧，我见到了很多拉特兰之外的风景，也知道了许多地方其实和拉特兰是不一样的。","id":260},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1810_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪乐","text":"你知道吗，我现在的愿望之一，就是找一座新的城市生活！","id":262},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":263},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"我还以为你只是个单纯的乐天派。","id":264,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"总之，回到拉特兰后，我反而开始对雕塑感兴趣，并且决定系统性地学习雕塑知识。","id":266,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":267},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"我心里想着，有一天，我会回到这里。","id":268,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1810_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":269},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪乐","text":"但是——拉特兰的雕塑，和这里的雕塑不一样吧？","id":270},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"......我当然知道。","id":272,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"当我开始系统性地学习雕塑后，我就没有一天不在悔恨——我应该趁原来的深根镇还在的时候，学习那里的雕塑技巧。","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"但是事已至此，我情愿用拉特兰的技术来延续这里的传统。","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"除非有人能找到更好的方法。","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1810_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":279},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪乐","text":"所以说，你其实希望苏珊能做到？","id":280},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"......开玩笑，我可不希望自己这五年的刻苦学习白费。","id":282,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"这块最大的石头，放这里。","id":284,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1810_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪乐","text":"好嘞。","id":286},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":287},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"总之，既然你要帮忙的话，就先从把石头切割成我要的大小开始吧。","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":289},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"当然，用拉特兰的方法来说，就是——","id":290,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1810_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":291},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪乐","text":"爆破！","id":292},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":293},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"唉，我就知道。你只要别把它变成一堆粉末就行。","id":294,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1810_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪乐","text":"放心，我可是爆破高手！","id":296},{"type":"dialog","id":297},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":298},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":299},{"type":"charslot","id":300},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":301},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/61/Avg_bg_bg_wilderness_y.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":302},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":303},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":304},{"type":"text","text":"街道早已被岁月冲刷得面目全非、泥泞不堪，四处散落着砖块和瓦砾，放眼望去，处处都是天灾留下的痕迹。","id":305},{"type":"text","text":"即使是最有经验的信使，也会选择小心翼翼地绕开这样危险的地方，但莫斯提马只是紧了紧帽檐，就毫不犹豫地踏入其中。","id":306},{"type":"text","text":"短短两年时间，她就已经过于熟悉这样的环境了。","id":307},{"type":"dialog","id":308},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":309},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_213_mostma_1#9$2","duration":"2","id":310},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":311},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":312},{"type":"charslot","duration":"2","id":313},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":314},{"type":"text","text":"如果是五年前的自己，恐怕此时并不会多此一举，不如说，她甚至不会站在这里，她想。","id":315},{"type":"text","text":"但是，这两年，作为万国信使，她踏过了太多前所未见的土地，见过了太多闻所未闻的轶事。","id":316},{"type":"text","text":"在踏足这片区域时，她已经隐隐对苏珊的话有了一些猜测。","id":317},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_213_mostma_1#12$2","id":318},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫斯提马","text":"那种气味的答案，或许很简单。","id":319,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_213_mostma_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_213_mostma_1#12$2","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫斯提马","text":"是吧，看来你也这么想。","id":321,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_213_mostma_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":322},{"type":"dialog","id":323},{"type":"text","text":"莫斯提马轻快地来到废墟中央的雕像前，小心地从雕像上取下一片残留的外壳，闻了闻。","id":324},{"type":"text","text":"然后，她又蹲下挖起一抔土壤，闻了闻。","id":325},{"type":"text","text":"和她想的一样。","id":326},{"type":"text","text":"所谓“镇子的气味”，它的秘方并不复杂——","id":327},{"type":"text","text":"它只是这片土地的土壤和雕塑用的石料混合后散发出的味道。","id":328},{"type":"text","text":"让镇民们感到亲切的原因也很简单，它既有这一带植被留在土壤里的清新气息，又有石料本身独特的矿物味。","id":329},{"type":"text","text":"二者都是镇民们最常闻到的气息，将它们混合起来，就成了独属于生活在这片土地上的人所怀念的气味。","id":330},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_213_mostma_1#12$2","id":331},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫斯提马","text":"说真的，不是什么好闻的气味。","id":332,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_213_mostma_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_213_mostma_1#12$2","id":333},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫斯提马","text":"不过......我们走过了那么多的地方，这种气味确实很独特，对吧？","id":334,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_213_mostma_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":335},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":336},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":337},{"type":"charslot","id":338},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":339},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b6/Avg_bg_31_g3_mini12_farmland.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":340},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":341},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":342},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1810_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪乐","text":"好了——炸药设置完毕。","id":344},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1810_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":345},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪乐","text":"根据我的精密计算，它炸开后，一定可以达成你要的结果！","id":346},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":347},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"......看不出来，你还真是这方面的行家。","id":348,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1810_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":349},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪乐","text":"嘻嘻，我说了，我可是搞爆破的专家！","id":350},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1810_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":351},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪乐","text":"那就开始吧，我按！","id":352},{"type":"charslot","id":353},{"type":"dialog","id":354},{"type":"text","text":"蕾缪乐的计算确实十分精确。","id":355},{"type":"dialog","id":356},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"50","ystrength":"50","vibrato":"60","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":357},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.2","block":"true","id":358},{"type":"playsound","key":"$b_char_rockexplo","volume":"1","id":359},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_explo_n","volume":"0.7","id":360},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_sp_ballista","volume":"1.0","id":361},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":362},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rockfall","volume":"1","id":363},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.7","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"4","block":"false","id":364},{"type":"text","text":"随着几声爆破声，巨大的石头恰如其分地裂成了数份。","id":365},{"type":"text","text":"唯一的问题是——她忘了石头的材质。","id":366},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":367},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"呃，忘了提醒你，这种石头爆破后会产生大量的粉尘。","id":368,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":369},{"type":"dialog","id":370},{"type":"text","text":"铺天盖地的粉尘笼罩了蕾缪乐，让她一时间睁不开眼。","id":371},{"type":"charslot","id":372},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪乐","text":"哇哇哇，我什么也看不见了！","id":373},{"type":"dialog","id":374},{"type":"charslot","id":375},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":376},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_213_mostma_1#4$2","duration":"1","id":377},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":378},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫斯提马","text":"咦，这是......","id":379,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b7/Avg_avg_213_mostma_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":380},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"莫——","id":381,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_213_mostma_1#12$2","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫斯提马","text":"嘘——","id":383,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_213_mostma_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":384},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪乐","text":"喂，我睁不开眼了，梅丽莎，快来扶我一下呀！","id":385},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":386},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"哎，当心！那边有坑——","id":387,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":388},{"type":"dialog","id":389},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":390},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":391},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪乐","text":"欸？哇啊——！","id":392},{"type":"text","text":"蕾缪乐感到自己脚一崴，身体瞬间失衡，眼看就要摔进旁边的坑里。","id":393},{"type":"text","text":"但就在这时，一只手抓住了她的手臂，将她拉了回来。","id":394},{"type":"charslot","id":395},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪乐","text":"梅丽莎，谢谢你——","id":396},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_213_mostma_1#7$2","id":397},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫斯提马","text":"小乐，你可要小心一些才行。","id":398,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ef/Avg_avg_213_mostma_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":399},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪乐","text":"欸，莫斯提马？！","id":400},{"type":"dialog","id":401},{"type":"charslot","id":402},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1810_1#9$1","focus":"m","duration":"1","id":403},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":404},{"type":"text","text":"听到那个熟悉的声音，她立刻使劲揉了揉眼，强行睁开了眼睛。","id":405},{"type":"text","text":"然而，眼前空无一人。","id":406},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1810_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":407},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪乐","text":"咳咳咳咳呸呸呸，莫斯提马？！","id":408},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1810_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":409},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪乐","text":"梅丽莎，刚才莫斯提马来过吗？","id":410},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1810_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":411},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪乐","text":"欸欸？怎么梅丽莎也不见了！！","id":412},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1810_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":413},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪乐","text":"这到底是怎么回事啊！！！","id":414},{"type":"dialog","id":415},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":416},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":417},{"type":"charslot","id":418},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":419},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_bg_bg_county_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":420},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":421},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":422},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_005","id":423},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朴实的镇长","text":"这个气味......","id":424,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_005","id":425},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朴实的镇长","text":"没错，就是这个气味......唔哦哦......呜呜......","id":426,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_005","id":427},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朴实的镇长","text":"这就是过去的深根镇的气味啊......","id":428,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":429},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"......确实是那种气味。","id":430,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":431},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"没想到它的原理居然这么简单。","id":432,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_213_mostma_1#2$2","id":433},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫斯提马","text":"越是简单的东西，反而越容易被铭记。","id":434,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ec/Avg_avg_213_mostma_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":435},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"......我不得不谢谢你们找回它，莫斯提马，苏珊。","id":436,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_003","id":437},{"type":"dialogue","name":"犹豫的女性","text":"......我才要谢谢你，梅丽莎。","id":438,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_003.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_003","id":439},{"type":"dialogue","name":"犹豫的女性","text":"没有你，我或许会一直在原地打转。","id":440,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_003.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":441},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"......哼，别高兴得太早。","id":442,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":443},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"既然这种气味的原理这么简单，那么，我为什么不能用上它呢？","id":444,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_213_mostma_1#7$2","id":445},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫斯提马","text":"很卑鄙嘛，梅丽莎。","id":446,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ef/Avg_avg_213_mostma_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":447},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"苏珊，你不会以为自己找到了那股气味，镇民们就会选择你吧？","id":448,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_003","id":449},{"type":"dialogue","name":"犹豫的女性","text":"不，我会雕刻出最好的雕像的！","id":450,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_003.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_005","id":451},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朴实的镇长","text":"我真不知道该怎么感谢你，莫斯提马，你为镇子找回了熟悉的气味，又为镇子注入了活力。","id":452,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_005.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_213_mostma_1#12$2","id":453},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫斯提马","text":"您说得太过了，镇长，这一切......都和我没有必然联系。","id":454,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_213_mostma_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":455},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"但我确实有些好奇，莫斯提马。","id":456,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":457},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"五年前，你跟在那位安多恩队长的后面一言不发。","id":458,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":459},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"为什么今天，忽然就跑来为我们做这些？","id":460,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_213_mostma_1#1$2","id":461},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫斯提马","text":"......","id":462,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_213_mostma_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":463},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":464},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":465},{"type":"charslot","id":466},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":467},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","keep":"true","amount":"1","fadetime":"0","id":468},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_bg_bg_cave_5.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":469},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":470},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":471},{"type":"text","text":"当她赶到现场的时候，看到的是狂乱的安多恩重伤了蕾缪安。","id":472},{"type":"text","text":"在那一瞬间，她捕捉到了许多情绪——有困惑、狂躁，也有释然、包容。","id":473},{"type":"text","text":"这让她心生疑惑，但并没有妨碍她的行动。","id":474},{"type":"text","text":"为了阻止安多恩，她最终只能使用守护铳，将锁与匙从他手中打落，并在夺取锁与匙后，带着蕾缪安离开。","id":475},{"type":"text","text":"在菲亚梅塔的陪同下，她们一起回到了拉特兰。","id":476},{"type":"dialog","id":477},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":478},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":479},{"type":"charslot","id":480},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":481},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/93/Avg_bg_26_g8_laterano_dwelling.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":482},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":483},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":484},{"type":"text","text":"随后，锁与匙被收回，她也遭到了软禁。","id":485},{"type":"text","text":"对于堕天，她完全没有后悔过。更让她在意的，始终是安多恩究竟在锁与匙之中看到了什么。","id":486},{"type":"text","text":"于是，她作出了一个大胆的决定——硬闯教皇厅。","id":487},{"type":"text","text":"毕竟，错过这次机会，她恐怕再也没有机会探明这个秘密。","id":488},{"type":"dialog","id":489},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":490},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":491},{"type":"charslot","id":492},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":493},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_bg_26_g2_laterano_cathedralhall.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":494},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":495},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":496},{"type":"text","text":"闯入教皇厅并不是那么容易的事，不过她最终还是成功了——","id":497},{"type":"text","text":"当然，现在想来，这显然是那位白胡子老头有意为之。不然的话，他也不会将锁与匙交给她来保管。","id":498},{"type":"text","text":"无论如何，她再次见到了锁与匙。","id":499},{"type":"text","text":"当她从安多恩手中将其夺下时，双杖并没有对她作出反应。","id":500},{"type":"text","text":"而这一次，当她带着疑问再次触碰双杖，她走入了一片幻境之中。","id":501},{"type":"text","text":"在那里，她看到了——","id":502},{"type":"text","text":"过去的缝隙。未来的断面。","id":503},{"type":"dialog","id":504},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":505},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":506},{"type":"text","text":"老实说，她对于安多恩看到了什么有大概的猜测。","id":507},{"type":"text","text":"而在幻境中见到那些景象后，她立刻理解了，为什么安多恩会陷入癫狂。","id":508},{"type":"text","text":"毕竟，那可是永远对未来忧心忡忡，永远会为一个十分微小的悲剧而扼腕叹息的安多恩。","id":509},{"type":"text","text":"某种意义上，她甚至可以说，菲亚梅塔如此愤怒于安多恩的作为，恰恰是源自菲亚梅塔对过去的他的认可——","id":510},{"type":"text","text":"很显然，对于心怀正义的菲亚梅塔而言，悲天悯人的安多恩比总是游离于事态之外的她要值得认可得多。","id":511},{"type":"text","text":"但对莫斯提马而言，她并不执着于安多恩为何陷入狂乱，并不单纯是因为那一刻，她从那两人身上捕捉到的情绪。","id":512},{"type":"text","text":"更多的是因为，她从一开始——或许是加入安多恩的小队，甚至是见到安多恩的那一瞬间，就已经隐隐有一种感觉——","id":513},{"type":"text","text":"安多恩走在和她完全相反的道路上，他迟早会和自己分道扬镳。","id":514},{"type":"text","text":"就像那时，眼前是万千的碎片，每一块碎片都可能预示着一个问题的答案，或许穷尽所有的碎片，终极问题的答案也将自然而然浮现。","id":515},{"type":"text","text":"安多恩必然会毫不犹豫地选择走向那些碎片，踏入那片闪烁着繁星的漆黑沼泽。","id":516},{"type":"text","text":"而她——选择了回头。","id":517},{"type":"dialog","id":518},{"type":"charslot","id":519},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":520},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","keep":"true","amount":"0","fadetime":"0","id":521},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_bg_bg_county_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":522},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":523},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":524},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_213_mostma_1#1$2","id":525},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫斯提马","text":"上一次，看到那幅光景的时候，我在想——","id":526,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_213_mostma_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_213_mostma_1#2$2","id":527},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫斯提马","text":"啊，真惨。","id":528,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ec/Avg_avg_213_mostma_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_213_mostma_1#12$2","id":529},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫斯提马","text":"除此之外，我无法产生更多的感想。","id":530,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_213_mostma_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_213_mostma_1#12$2","id":531},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫斯提马","text":"以至于我并不能理解某人当时的挣扎。","id":532,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_213_mostma_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_213_mostma_1#12$2","id":533},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫斯提马","text":"但现在——","id":534,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_213_mostma_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":535},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":536},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_213_mostma_1#12$1","duration":"1","id":537},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":538},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_003","id":539},{"type":"dialogue","name":"犹豫的女性","text":"莫斯提马姐姐，你的角，你......","id":540,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_003.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_368_1#1$1","id":541},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稳重的女性","text":"你堕天了？！","id":542,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_368_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_213_mostma_1#12$1","id":543},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫斯提马","text":"这两年，作为万国信使，我一直在外面旅行，最后，我得出了一个结论——","id":544,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dc/Avg_avg_213_mostma_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_213_mostma_1#7$1","id":545},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫斯提马","text":"哦，朋友，萨科塔真是一群可爱的混账。","id":546,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_213_mostma_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_213_mostma_1#7$1","id":547},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫斯提马","text":"我只是在了解自己是个混账之后......重新学着和这片大地相处罢了。","id":548,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_213_mostma_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_213_mostma_1#5$1","id":549},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫斯提马","text":"对了，记得替我告诉小乐，我接到了新的任务，下一站，要去龙门待一段时间。","id":550,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_213_mostma_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_213_mostma_1#5$1","id":551},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫斯提马","text":"正好，半年前在旅途中遇到过一个叫大帝的家伙，他也在龙门，可以去拜访他一下。","id":552,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_213_mostma_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":553},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":554},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":555},{"type":"charslot","id":556},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":557},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_bg_bg_outcounty.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":558},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":559},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":560},{"type":"text","text":"走到山坡上，莫斯提马回过头。","id":561},{"type":"text","text":"从这里，隐约能够看到广场上发生的事。","id":562},{"type":"text","text":"广场上，苏珊和梅丽莎已经各自开始了准备，越来越多的人被二人行为吸引，在广场上聚集起来。","id":563},{"type":"text","text":"在所有人之中，有一个红发萨科塔特别显眼，她在两边走来走去，这边帮一下，那边帮一下，俨然忘了自己的初衷。","id":564},{"type":"text","text":"莫斯提马难得地没有戴起兜帽，任由微风拂过她的脸颊，吹起她的发梢。","id":565},{"type":"dialog","id":566},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":567},{"type":"sticker","id":568,"multi":"true","text":"安多恩，现在，我比以前多理解你一些了。","x":"300","y":"270","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":569,"multi":"true","text":"\\n也许我该和你多喝几杯？也许我该给你和蕾缪安多留一些独处的时间？","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":570,"multi":"true","text":"\\n好吧，当然，我知道，你最终还是会离开的。","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":571,"multi":"true","text":"\\n但是，有一点，就让我在这里把它说明白吧。","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":572},{"type":"sticker","id":573,"multi":"true","text":"正是在理解你之后，我才可以这么说——","x":"300","y":"270","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":574,"multi":"true","text":"\\n我不会做出和你一样的选择。","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":575},{"type":"sticker","id":576,"multi":"true","text":"没有东西可以承担所有人的幸福，你做不到，我做不到，拉特兰也做不到。","x":"300","y":"270","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":577,"multi":"true","text":"\\n我们或许永远只能顾及目所能及之处。","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":578,"multi":"true","text":"\\n就像我这两年带着小乐到处跑，就是我对她为了找我而跑出拉特兰所负的一点责任，仅此而已。","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":579,"multi":"true","text":"\\n所以，我不会像菲亚梅塔那么恨你，但是，下次见面，我也不会给你什么好脸色。","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":580},{"type":"sticker","id":581,"multi":"true","text":"那么，让我们在旅途的某个角落再会吧。","x":"300","y":"270","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":582},{"type":"dialog","id":583},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":584},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":585},{"type":"charslot","id":586},{"type":"charslot","id":587},{"type":"image","id":588}],"characters":["朴实的镇长","犹豫的女性","稳重的女性","莫斯提马","蕾缪乐"]}